; P200.macro — ATC geometry configuration (four-positions style)
;
; Copy this file to the grblHAL filesystem root and set the startup line:
;
;   $N0=G65P200
;
; This ensures geometry parameters are loaded automatically on every boot.
; To set the startup line, send the above command from MDI or a terminal.
;
; This macro sets the geometry parameters used by atc_change.ngc and
; atc_return.ngc.  All coordinates are machine coordinates (G53).
;
; ── four-positions concept ───────────────────────────────────────────
;
;   Unloading a tool (deposit into pocket):   P1 → P2 → P3 [open]  → P4
;   Loading a tool  (pick up from pocket):    P4 → P3 [close] → P2 → P1
;
;   Position 1 — Safe:     clear of the carousel, safe for any XY travel
;   Position 2 — Approach: aligned with the pocket, above/beside entry point
;   Position 3 — Engage:   tool fully seated in pocket (drawbar actuates here)
;   Position 4 — Exit:     spindle clear of pocket after release or clamp
;
;   Pocket positioning (rotating the carousel to the correct pocket) is handled
;   externally — either by a dedicated axis (A/B) or by a separate MCU.
;   The carousel must be at the correct pocket before the spindle moves to P2.
;
; ── Parameters set by this macro ─────────────────────────────────────────────
;
;   #4920  P1 X  Safe position X
;   #4921  P1 Y  Safe position Y
;   #4922  P1 Z  Safe position Z  (typically Z home = 0)
;
;   #4923  P2 X  Approach X
;   #4924  P2 Y  Approach Y
;   #4925  P2 Z  Approach Z
;
;   #4926  P3 X  Engage X
;   #4927  P3 Y  Engage Y
;   #4928  P3 Z  Engage Z
;
;   #4929  P4 X  Exit X
;   #4930  P4 Y  Exit Y
;   #4931  P4 Z  Exit Z
;
;   #4932        Feed rate for all carousel positioning moves (mm/min)
;

; ── Position 1: Safe ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#4920 = -80.71       ; X (machine coords)
#4921 = 2.000        ; Y
#4922 = 0.0          ; Z — typically Z home

; ── Position 2: Approach ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#4923 = -80.71        ; X (machine coords) beside pocket
#4924 = 2.000         ; Y
#4925 = -137.81       ; Z

; ── Position 3: Engage ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#4926 = -20.71        ; X (machine coords)
#4927 =  2.000        ; Y
#4928 = -137.81       ; Z - tool fully seated

; ── Position 4: Exit ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#4929 = -20.71        ; X (machine coords)
#4930 = 2.0000        ; Y
#4931 = 0.00000       ; Z - spindle fully clear

; ── Feed rate ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#4932 = 1500.0       ; mm/min — all carousel positioning moves

; ── Toolsetter ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Toolsetter XYZ is read from G59.3 at probe time (#5381, #5382, #5383).
; Configure G59.3 via G10 L2 P9 or the grblHAL coordinate system settings.

; ── Carousel homing ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Home the carousel
; G65 P7 performs the carousel homing cycle; P201 is picohal specific to check success.
;G65 P7 S3 F16 R1 A1
;g4p1
;G65 P201

M2
